  {
   "i": 132,
   "shape_h": "p",
   "shape_m": "p",
   "html_text": "However, it is characteristic of sentences of the form (17) that the noun argument and the VP argument are not on a par. The noun combines with the determiner to form the NP, a separate constituent, and this constituent can also be taken to signify a generalized quantifier, this time of type ⟦M⟧ . Thus, at least five students denotes the set of subsets of the universe which contain at least five students. This quantifier results from freezing the first argument of the type ⟦M⟧ three to the set o",
   "md_text": "However, it is characteristic of sentences of the form (17) that the noun argument and the VP argument are not on a par. The noun combines with the determiner to form the NP, a separate constituent, and this constituent can also be taken to signify a generalized quantifier, this time of type ⟦M⟧ . Thus, at least five students denotes the set of subsets of the universe which contain at least five students. This quantifier results from freezing the first argument of the type ⟦M⟧ three to the set o"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "shape_h": "p",
